sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant C as Client
    participant P as Proxy<br/>(load_balance_proxy)
    participant PF as Prefill<br/>(vllm serve)<br/>kv_role=kv_producer
    participant PFSched as Prefill Scheduler<br/>(MooncakeConnectorScheduler)
    participant PFW as Prefill Worker<br/>(MooncakeConnectorWorker)
    participant PFST as Prefill SendingThread<br/>(KVCacheSendingThread)
    participant TE_P as TransferEngine<br/>(Prefill端)
    participant TE_D as TransferEngine<br/>(Decode端)
    participant DWR as Decode RecvThread<br/>(KVCacheRecvingThread)
    participant DW as Decode Worker<br/>(MooncakeConnectorWorker)
    participant DSched as Decode Scheduler<br/>(MooncakeConnectorScheduler)
    participant D as Decode<br/>(vllm serve)<br/>kv_role=kv_consumer

    rect rgb(232,245,233)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 启动阶段：Prefill 端初始化 ══════════
    Note over PFW: register_kv_caches()<br/>1. 获取 KV cache 的 data_ptr() 和 shape<br/>2. 计算 block_len = element_size × prod(block_shape)<br/>3. 计算 kv_caches_base_addr 列表<br/>4. 调用 global_te.register_buffer(ptrs, lengths)
    PFW->>TE_P: register_memory(ptr, size)<br/>将每层 KV cache 显存地址注册到 TransferEngine
    Note over PFW: 组装 MooncakeAgentMetadata:<br/>{engine_id, te_rpc_port,<br/>kv_caches_base_addr, num_blocks, local_ip}
    PFW->>PFST: 启动 KVCacheSendingThread<br/>传入 metadata + side_channel_host/port
    Note over PFST: run():<br/>计算 handshake_port =<br/>kv_port + dp_rank×tp×pp×pcp + device_index<br/>在 tcp://host:handshake_port 上<br/>bind ZMQ ROUTER socket<br/>进入 run_busy_loop() 等待请求
    end

    rect rgb(227,242,253)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 启动阶段：Decode 端初始化 ══════════
    Note over DW: register_kv_caches()<br/>1. 同样获取 KV cache 的 data_ptr() 和 shape<br/>2. 计算 block_len<br/>3. 调用 global_te.register_buffer(ptrs, lengths)
    DW->>TE_D: register_memory(ptr, size)<br/>将每层 KV cache 显存地址注册到 TransferEngine
    Note over DW: 启动 KVCacheRecvingThread<br/>传入 engine + side_channel_host/port + kv_caches_base_addr
    Note over DWR: run():<br/>ready_event.set()<br/>进入循环等待 request_queue.get()
    end

    rect rgb(255,243,224)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段1：Client 请求到达 Proxy ══════════
    C->>P: HTTP POST /v1/completions<br/>stream=true, max_tokens=N,<br/>prompt="..."
    end

    rect rgb(252,228,236)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段2：Proxy 选 Prefiller 并发送 Prefill 请求 ══════════
    Note right of P: 1. 计算负载分数 prefiller_score<br/>2. 最小堆 select_prefiller()<br/>3. 生成 request_id = uuid4()<br/>4. acquire_aborted_prefiller_requests()
    P->>PF: HTTP POST /v1/completions<br/>X-Request-Id: {uuid}<br/>stream=false, max_tokens=1, min_tokens=1<br/>kv_transfer_params: {<br/>  do_remote_decode: true,<br/>  do_remote_prefill: false,<br/>  remote_engine_id: null,<br/>  remote_block_ids: null,<br/>  remote_host: null,<br/>  remote_port: null,<br/>  aborted_request: [req_a, req_b]<br/>}

    Note over PF: vllm 正常调度请求<br/>执行 prefill 计算<br/>生成 1 个 token 后结束<br/>status = FINISHED_LENGTH_CAPPED

    Note over PFSched: request_finished() 检测到:<br/>do_remote_decode=true<br/>且 status=FINISHED_LENGTH_CAPPED<br/>→ 延迟释放 KV block<br/>→ 加入 _reqs_need_send<br/>→ 组装返回给 proxy 的 kv_transfer_params

    PFSched->>PFSched: 计算延迟释放信息:<br/>delay_free_blocks = len(block_ids) > 0<br/>num_prompt_blocks = ceil(prompt_len / block_size)<br/>_reqs_need_send[req_id] = time.time()

    PF-->>P: HTTP 200 JSON Response<br/>{<br/>  kv_transfer_params: {<br/>    do_remote_prefill: true,<br/>    do_remote_decode: false,<br/>    remote_block_ids: [0,1,2,3,4],<br/>    remote_engine_id: "engine_abc",<br/>    remote_request_id: "req_xxx",<br/>    remote_host: "10.101.26.98",<br/>    remote_port: 30000,<br/>    remote_pcp_size: 1,<br/>    remote_dcp_size: 1,<br/>    remote_ptp_size: 8,<br/>    last_token_id: 12345,<br/>    remote_multi_nodes_meta_mapping: {<br/>      "0": {host:"10.101.26.98", engine_id:"engine_abc"},<br/>      "1": {host:"10.101.26.98", engine_id:"engine_abc"}<br/>    },<br/>    num_prompt_blocks: 5<br/>  }<br/>}

    Note over P: 释放 prefiller 的 active_tokens<br/>保留 active_kv_cache（等 decode 第一个 chunk）
    end

    rect rgb(225,245,254)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段3：Proxy 选 Decoder 并转发 Decode 请求 ══════════
    Note right of P: 最小堆 select_decoder()
    P->>D: HTTP POST /v1/completions<br/>X-Request-Id: {同一个uuid}<br/>stream=true, max_tokens=N<br/>原始 prompt<br/>kv_transfer_params: {prefill返回的完整版}
    end

    rect rgb(243,229,245)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段4：Decode 调度器识别远端 Prefill 请求 ══════════
    Note over DSched: get_num_new_matched_tokens():<br/>检测到 do_remote_prefill=true<br/>count = len(prompt_token_ids) - num_computed_tokens<br/>返回 (count, True)<br/>→ 不本地 prefill，等远端 KV

    Note over DSched: update_state_after_alloc():<br/>检测到 do_remote_prefill=true 且 remote_block_ids 存在<br/>local_block_ids = blocks.get_unhashed_block_ids()<br/>_reqs_need_recv[req_id] = (request, local_block_ids, num_external_tokens)<br/>do_remote_prefill 置为 False（只触发1次）

    Note over DSched: build_connector_meta():<br/>遍历 _reqs_need_recv<br/>对每个 req 调用 meta.add_new_req():<br/>→ 构建 ReqMeta {<br/>  local_block_ids, num_external_tokens,<br/>  remote_block_ids, remote_host, remote_port,<br/>  remote_engine_id, remote_request_id,<br/>  remote_pcp/dcp/ptp_size,<br/>  remote_multi_nodes_meta_mapping,<br/>  num_prompt_blocks<br/>}<br/>清空 _reqs_need_recv
    end

    rect rgb(255,253,231)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段5：Decode Worker 发起远端 KV 拉取 ══════════
    Note over DW: start_load_kv(metadata):<br/>遍历 metadata.requests:<br/>1. 计算 tp_num_need_pulls<br/>2. 计算 chosen_rank_list（基于 request_id 哈希）<br/>3. 计算 remote_handshake_port_list<br/>4. 对每个 (offset, tp_num_need_pulls) 组合<br/>   调用 kv_recv_thread.add_request()

    Note over DWR: 从 request_queue 取出任务<br/>调用 _handle_request()

    rect rgb(187,222,251)
    Note over DWR,PFST: ──────── ZMQ Side-Channel 交互1: GET_META ────────
    DWR->>PFST: ZMQ REQ→ROUTER<br/>tcp://{prefill_ip}:{handshake_port}<br/>msgpack encode: (b"get_meta_msg", "")
    Note over PFST: run_busy_loop() 收到 frames<br/>解码 msg = (GET_META_MSG, "")<br/>返回预编码的 MooncakeAgentMetadata
    PFST-->>DWR: ZMQ ROUTER→REQ<br/>msgpack: MooncakeAgentMetadata {<br/>  engine_id: "engine_abc",<br/>  te_rpc_port: 23456,<br/>  kv_caches_base_addr: [0x7f..., 0x7f..., ...],<br/>  num_blocks: 1024,<br/>  local_ip: "10.101.26.98"<br/>}
    Note over DWR: 缓存远端 metadata:<br/>kv_caches_base_addr["engine_abc"][port] = [addr_list]<br/>remote_te_port["engine_abc"][port] = 23456
    end

    rect rgb(200,230,201)
    Note over DWR,TE_P: ──────── Mooncake TransferEngine: KV 数据传输 ────────
    Note over DWR: _transfer_kv_cache():<br/>1. num_local_blocks = len(local_block_ids)<br/>2. 如果为0 → prefix cache 全命中，跳过传输<br/>3. group_concurrent_contiguous() 合并连续 block<br/>4. 计算 layer 范围 [first_layer_index, end_layer_index)<br/>5. MTP层: end_layer_index += 1<br/>6. 拼接 src_list/dst_list/length_list:<br/>   src = local_base + local_block_id×block_len + offset×inner_len<br/>   dst = remote_base + remote_block_id×inner_len<br/>   length = inner_len × num_contiguous_blocks

    DWR->>TE_D: batch_transfer_sync_read(<br/>  session_id="10.101.26.98:23456",<br/>  src_list=[本地KV显存地址],<br/>  dst_list=[远端KV显存地址],<br/>  length_list=[每段字节数]<br/>)
    TE_D->>TE_P: ASCEND P2P RDMA-like 直读<br/>按 layer/block/head 从 prefill 显存<br/>直接搬到 decode 显存
    TE_P-->>TE_D: 传输完成
    TE_D-->>DWR: ret = 0 (成功)

    Note over DWR: 传输后处理:<br/>1. tp_num_need_pulls>1 → reformat_kv_cache<br/>   (GQA 场景按 head 拼装)<br/>2. enable_kv_nz → NZ 格式转换<br/>3. 可选用 fused op 加速:<br/>   torch.ops._C_ascend.transpose_kv_cache_by_block
    end

    rect rgb(187,222,251)
    Note over DWR,PFST: ──────── ZMQ Side-Channel 交互2: DONE_RECVING ────────
    DWR->>PFST: ZMQ REQ→ROUTER<br/>msgpack: (<br/>  b"done_recving_msg",<br/>  request_id,<br/>  remote_port_send_num: {<br/>    30000: {num:1, host:"10.101.26.98"},<br/>    30001: {num:1, host:"10.101.26.98"}<br/>  }<br/>)
    Note over PFST: 统计每个端口的 DONE_RECVING 数<br/>当 port_send_num[req] >= remote_port_send_num[port]["num"]<br/>→ task_tracker.update_done_task_count(req_id)<br/>→ 允许释放该 request 的 KV block
    PFST-->>DWR: ZMQ ROUTER→REQ<br/>b"ACK"
    end

    Note over DWR: _send_done_signal_to_free_remote_port():<br/>对 remote_port_send_num 中 num==0 的端口<br/>也发送 DONE_RECVING<br/>（释放那些不需要传数据但占着资源的端口）
    end

    rect rgb(255,249,196)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段6：Decode 继续生成并流式返回 ══════════
    Note over D: 远端 KV 已注入本地 paged KV cache<br/>scheduler 正常调度 decode step<br/>逐 token 生成

    D-->>P: SSE: data: {"choices":[{"text":"你","stop_reason":null}]}
    Note over P: 收到第一个 chunk 时<br/>release_prefiller_kv(prefiller_idx, score)<br/>→ 释放 prefiller 的 active_kv_cache
    P-->>C: SSE 透传

    D-->>P: SSE: data: {"choices":[{"text":"好","stop_reason":null}]}
    P-->>C: SSE 透传

    D-->>P: SSE: data: {"choices":[{"text":"","stop_reason":"stop"}]}
    P-->>C: SSE 透传
    end

    rect rgb(255,224,178)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段7 (可选)：stop_reason=recomputed 重试 ══════════
    alt 远端 KV 已失效 (block 被提前释放)
        D-->>P: SSE: data: {"choices":[{"stop_reason":"recomputed"}]}
        Note over P: 把已生成 token 拼回 prompt:<br/>messages[0]["content"] = origin_prompt + generated_token<br/>max_tokens = origin_max_tokens - completion_tokens + retry_count
        P->>PF: 重新选 prefiller，发 prefill 请求<br/>(新的 kv_transfer_params 初始版)
        PF-->>P: 返回新 kv_transfer_params
        P->>D: 重新选 decoder，转发 decode 请求<br/>(新 prompt + 新 kv_transfer_params)
        D-->>P: SSE 流式返回
        P-->>C: SSE 透传
    end
    end

    rect rgb(207,216,220)
    Note over C,D: ══════════ 阶段8：请求完成，资源释放 ══════════
    Note over P: release_decoder(decoder_idx, score)<br/>release_prefiller_kv 已在阶段6释放

    Note over DSched: get_finished():<br/>返回 done_recving 集合<br/>→ scheduler 释放该 request 的本地 block

    Note over PFSched: get_finished():<br/>返回 done_sending 集合<br/>→ scheduler 释放延迟的 KV block

    Note over PFST: 若超时未收到 DONE_RECVING:<br/>VLLM_NIXL_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT<br/>→ _retrieve_expired_requests()<br/>→ 强制释放 block
    end
